        "title": "Membuat Objek",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148559,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Misalkan kita memiliki dua variabel, <code>playerName</code> dan <code>playerHealth</code>, yang keduanya berkaitan dengan pemain yang sama.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>playerName</code>, diikuti oleh <code>playerHealth</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148560,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Daripada menggunakan dua variabel terpisah untuk mendeskripsikan pemain kita, kita bisa mengelompokkannya ke dalam satu variabel, yang dikenal sebagai <strong>object</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148561,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita membuat objek dengan cara yang mirip seperti variabel, menggunakan kata kunci <code>const</code> yang diikuti nama, tanda sama dengan, dan kurung kurawal <code>{}</code>. Contohnya, <code>const player = {};</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const</code>, diikuti oleh <code>player</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>{}</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148562,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Informasi di dalam sebuah object dikenal sebagai <strong>properties</strong> milik object tersebut. Properties diletakkan di dalam kurung kurawal object <code>{}</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>name: \"Nova\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148563,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita membuat properti dengan nama terlebih dahulu, diikuti titik dua <code>:</code> dan nilai, seperti <code>health: 100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>health</code>, diikuti oleh <code>:</code>, dan terakhir <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148564,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang mengikuti tanda sama dengan saat kita membuat objek baru?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kurung kurawal <code>{}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kurung <code>()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kurung kurawal <code>{}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148565,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kelompokkan properti tersebut ke dalam objek <code>player</code>.</p><code name=\"script1.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Nova&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>{</code>, diikuti oleh <code>name:</code>, lalu <code>\"Nova\"</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148566,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk informasi yang terdapat di dalam kurung kurawal <code>{}</code> milik sebuah objek?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Properti objek</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Variabel objek</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Properti objek.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148567,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita membuat property, apa yang kita letakkan di antara nama dan nilainya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Titik dua <code>:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Koma <code>,</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Titik dua <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148568,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Susun kode untuk membuat objek.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = { } ;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const</code>, diikuti oleh <code>enemy</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148569,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat objek musuh dengan properti <code>name: \"Slime\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>const</code>, diikuti oleh <code>enemy</code>, lalu <code>=</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>name: \"Slime\"</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148570,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk sekelompok konten terkait yang dikelompokkan ke dalam satu variabel?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebuah objek</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Sekumpulan variabel</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebuah objek.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148571,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berikan properti <code>score</code> dengan nilai <code>0</code> kepada pemain.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>score: 0</code>.</p></body></html>"
