      {
        "id": 17520,
        "title": "Properti Objek",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148572,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menambahkan lebih banyak properti ke objek, awali dengan koma, lalu tambahkan properti tersebut.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>className: \"Archer\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah object dapat memiliki sebanyak apa pun properti yang kita inginkan, selama setiap properti dipisahkan dengan koma.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148574,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Properti objek dapat berupa angka, string, boolean, array, atau bahkan objek lain. <br /><br />Atur properti <code>health</code> objek ke angka <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"79\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148575,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa menggunakan <code>console.log()</code> untuk menampilkan isi objek <code>player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>console.log</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>player</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148576,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita mengakses properti sebuah objek menggunakan nama objek, <code>.</code>, dan nama properti, seperti <code>player.health</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"102\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"103\" /><option startIndex=\"103\" endIndex=\"109\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.health);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>player</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148577,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah mengakses nilai properti, kita dapat memperbaruinya menggunakan tanda sama dengan. Sebagai contoh, coba tulis kode <code>player.health = 80</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"101\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"className\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"level\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.health = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>player.health = 80</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148578,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang diletakkan di antara setiap properti?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Koma <code>,</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koma <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148579,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang akan ditampilkan oleh <code>console.log(myObject)</code> untuk objek <code>myObject</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Object dan propertinya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya nama objek</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Object dan propertinya.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148580,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sisipkan koma yang hilang di antara properti objek.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148581,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan <code>health</code> milik objek <code>enemy</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;type&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"101\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"health\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"speed\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"aggressive\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy.health);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>enemy</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>health</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
